Soundtrack replacement: a music track whose sound file is in <prefix>_MUSIC_DIR
(named by the FNV-1a 64 of the first 4 KiB of its data, 16-bit stereo 44.1 kHz
PCM, sample p = the game's position p) plays from that file instead of the
decoded one; the game keeps its own positions and loops. F6 switches between the
soundtrack and the game's own music at the same point. Same code as VC3. (2026-11-25)

